Cursor Automation Runbook

# Cursor Automation

## Purpose

Automate approved repository workflows.

## Trigger

Manual invocation by authorized users.

## Scope

Approved repositories only.

## Branch Policy

Feature branches only.
Direct execution against main is prohibited.

## Secrets Policy

No secrets stored in prompts.
Use approved secret management solutions.

## MCP Policy

Only approved MCP integrations may be used.

## Review Path

Output requires pull request review before merge.

## Monitoring

Repository activity logs.

## Rollback

Revert pull request or commit.

## Proven Run

Data quality documentation update completed on test branch.
